==Notes and Points of Interest==
===[[Stargate]]===
Stargate is a gateway hidden beneath the central waters of the Black Shores archipelago, where data surges endlessly downward like a torrent. Descend through the Stargate, and when gravity reverses its hold, [[Tethys' Deep]] shall reveal itself. From here data turns into stars, lighting up the sky beneath.

===Communication Interference===
The frequencies emitted by the Tacetites disrupt standard communication signals. Communication with the outside world is only possible via the Black Shores' Beacon relay system.

===Blake Bloom===
Shaped by the unique environment of the Black Shores, the rare Remnant plant has since become the region's symbol. Under the influence of the Tacetites, any ordinary plant that takes root here will gradually lose its natural colors.

